## Definition of investor/tax readiness

Do not remove the **management draft** label until two consecutive monthly closes meet all gates:

- every bank, card, wallet, processor-clearing, and member-custody account reconciles to its external statement or controlled roll-forward with a $0 unexplained difference;
- Square clearing is $0.00 or contains only documented timing items, and every payout residual has an owner, evidence, and expected clearance date;
- Square loan opening balance + advances/fees − payments = ending lender statement, with CPA-approved fee presentation;
- 100% of active accounts have a legal owner/entity, custody role, and opening-balance anchor;
- 100% of post-policy PERSONAL items name the member and resolve through due-from, repayment, or approved reclassification;
- every material expense has source evidence and business purpose, with an accountant-approved sampling/control policy for immaterial items;
- trial balance debits equal credits; balance sheet balances; comparative reports reproduce from a locked snapshot;
- no duplicate economic event exists among provider events, bank feeds, Local Effort projections, manual imports, and journal postings;
- closed-period changes require a reversing/correcting entry, approval, and durable audit evidence; and
- Weston, Catherine, and Local Effort can each be reported independently, with all related-party balances and activity explicitly disclosed.
